    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8de5311ac8e00cab87364ce6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在下一场演唱会的练习中，\n美浦波旁对“传达心意”这件事\n感到困难而烦恼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "139b3098cec7b90e9fa42949abbb179838b422bcbd73cc05b8fd9ae82bfc4b3c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
