      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在演唱会开始前，为成员们加油的声音\n传到了舞台边幕旁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea8899aeae26c50b4ba6b36c9ab97761f56f3b9cbaf821d9548d6a25c1c7a9a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003437.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d04beb3f2272c0a74593461f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听到那些声音，爱丽速子说──\n祈愿可说是剧药。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17391fdf989ac89ac0865de4affafd1d631d48aa41c8673a5cc2056f019d32c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
