    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4d4ff15465427df95c49283",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰气喘吁吁地\n从舞台上向观众发声，\n但是观众们的反应冷淡稀疏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8d7a757409310cd1d06a94253f0b84aec533e00db75de0f03fe3028125a3f7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003441.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45627d656373b242393fc69c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使如此，她仍不灰心，\n努力地邀请观众一起唱歌，\n并且更卖力地把歌曲传达出去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92402816071c581d56760546ed0a4a4d3c216ac5a6fb446bd9e3c74e8128e3bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003441.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b0bf0a72ee6cb4cd6d5dcca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后，总算有赛马娘配合歌曲一起哼唱，\n而且越来越多人被她的热诚打动。\n渐渐地，有什么东西开始产生变化。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab30fa53d0b1b6257acdb3d3d4dcc7f20d84fa9671bf429707b7a3f2598364ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003441.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
