    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fb653a1e5c0160011a45370",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "逐渐开始受到瞩目后，在某天的演唱会上，\n传来“演唱会是属于巨星赛马娘的，\n跟赢不了比赛的自己无关”这样的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65263261a73d58397e26c62dc46807735299f7669881e70d5e748a34ebe95505",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003443.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6022da4fc2674df5d5bd9710",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰认为不是那样的。\n即使在竞赛无法获胜，赛马娘也还是有\n想亲自用声音传达给粉丝的心意才是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36a63214fdd6e4d492a57fe329d5f4f0358c30aae0a430a7e1cc5b528121d5b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003443.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9654ead14293333a3497e3b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，她希望打造出有别于胜者舞台，\n能够纯粹地向粉丝表达感谢的地方。\n为了这个目标，希望大家可以帮忙──",
      "source_fingerprint": "95e426db0a834fa314fd9fb123b3e75cf6e1d6047c028d52a6ad168c38899cef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003443.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1a3c14c69d03e76906b5c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰的热诚引领原本对活动\n不感兴趣的赛马娘们，往Grand Live迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa4f9cf3d669751466755f9e7ac53e67935592b420f208e62d36736b5c8921ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0003/storytimeline_400003443.json",
